-- the Rule 4.6 substitution already on this fixture) and Boston as SBHL Edmonton Oilers (EA 959, the club it also used
-- against Seattle at 10:10). The poller reads only league-linked clubs, so a match between two outside clubs never reached
-- the archive; it was found by asking EA for the histories of clubs 8910 and 959 directly: match 2172454790005, ended
